  "releaseNotes": "A patch for two things accessibility reviews found. A text or outlined alert's text now reaches WCAG AA's 4.5:1 on its own ground in light and dark, where MudBlazor's darken shade fell as low as 1.4:1; and a menu opened with the pointer no longer highlights its first row.\n\nWhat changed, and how to upgrade: https://github.com/FiliArrochada/Fili.Theme.MudAvalonia/blob/6ad77100762e4fedb5e0a8e0226b3f45d13e7c71/docs/versions/1.0.1.md",
